      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test. The original has several understandability issues: unused imports, an unused helper method `prepareStartTimer`, and an unused `DURATION` constant. I'll clean those up and add a focused comment that explains the key invariant being tested.The test compiled successfully. The improved version removes unused imports, the unused `prepareStartTimer` helper, and the unused `DURATION` constant, then adds a focused Javadoc explaining exactly why the mock is replayed with no expectations — clarifying the key invariant that a shared executor must not be touched on shutdown."
